\ChangesListline {replaced}{Replaced\nobreakspace {}(rev4)}{For our analysis, we utilised those datasets for which the \textit {pyKT} library \citep {liu2022pykt} provides standardised preprocessing mechanisms, thereby ensuring a rigorous and consistent treatment of student interactions. From this collection, we excluded those datasets that lack explicit mapping to Knowledge Components (\textit {Statics2011} and \textit {POJ}), as this information is essential for pedagogical interpretability, allowing mastery estimations to be anchored to defined educational concepts. The five datasets selected for this study are described below:}{17}
\ChangesListline {replaced}{Replaced\nobreakspace {}(rev4)}{characterised by subject trees}{17}
